flowchart TB
 T[Telegram-бот API] -->|HTTPS webhook| N[Nginx]
 A[Администратор] -->|HTTPS| N
 N --> API[FastAPI: Bot, Диалог, Поиск, Каталог, Profile, SQLAdmin, Аналитика]
 P[Telethon Parser: ручной запуск] -->|MTProto| MT[Telegram MTProto]
 P --> DB[(PostgreSQL + pgvector)]
 P --> M[(MinIO)]
 W[Worker: extraction / indexing / maintenance / outbox] --> DB
 W --> M
 W --> L[External text LLM]
 API --> DB
 API --> M
 API --> L
 W -->|sendMessage| T
 API -.->|enqueue jobs| DB
